      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Klyde Warren Park, a 5.2‑acre urban oasis, stitches together Uptown’s real‑estate buzz with Downtown Dallas’s thriving Arts District.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
